ding Sep (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"},{"date":"2026-12-07","type":"agm","what":"第22届常年股东大会","what_en":"22nd Annual General Meeting","ann":"11693291","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11693291","src":"ai"}],"recent_en":"Ni Hsin signed an MOU with China's Horwin to assemble electric motorcycles in Malaysia, with the first batch expected in 2027 for the Malaysian and Turkish markets. The company proposed a bonus issue of up to 312.65 million Warrant C on the basis of 1 warrant for every 2 existing shares. It also received a trading reminder from Bursa after its share price plunged 41% in a day, and said it was not aware of any reason for the unusual trading.","notable_en":["Signed an MOU with Horwin to assemble electric motorcycles in Malaysia, with the first batch expected in 2027 for Malaysia and Türkiye.","Proposed a bonus issue of up to 312.65 million Warrant C on the basis of 1 warrant for every 2 existing shares.","Received a trading reminder from Bursa after its share price plunged 41% in a single day."],"risks_en":["Bursa issued a trading reminder after the share price plunged 41% in a single day.","Executive Director Ng Shwu Ching disposed a total of 2,217,300 indirect shares on 28 September 2026.","The company recorded a net loss of RM1.714 million in Q4 FY2026, with revenue down 12.9% year-on-year."],"earnings_en":"For Q4 FY2026 (ended 30 June), revenue was RM8.355 million, up 25.7% QoQ but down 12.9% YoY; net loss was RM1.714 million, with a net loss margin of 20.5%, narrower than 54.0% in the previous quarter."}